# SYNTHETIC FIXTURE ONLY — invented for unit tests / AC2 demo.
# NOT a real 嘸蝦米 / Boshiamy code table. Do not ship as user data.
#
# Mapping used by AC2 (distance-1 substitutions marked with *):
#   這 aa | 樣 ab
#   如 ba | 甘 bb*   (typed bb → 甘, intended ba → 如)
#   果 bc
#   偶 ca | 側 cb*   (typed cb → 側, intended ca → 偶)
#   爾 da | 而 db*   (typed db → 而, intended da → 爾)
#   打 ea | 錯 eb | 一 ec | 個 ed | 字 ee | 也 ef | 沒 eg | 關 eh | 係 ei
#
%ename SyntheticAC2
%cname 合成AC2測試碼表
%chardef begin
aa	這
ab	樣
ba	如
bb	甘
bc	果
ca	偶
cb	側
da	爾
db	而
ea	打
eb	錯
ec	一
ed	個
ee	字
ef	也
eg	沒
eh	關
ei	係
%chardef end
